  "method": "NHANES DEMO+BMX 2007-2018 merged on SEQN; examined persons under 20 yr with measured weight and stature (recumbent length < 24 months, standing height otherwise), n = 23540. OLS of log10 weight on log10 stature across individuals (95% CI from the regression standard error; RMA slope as sensitivity), and the same regression on the 240 monthly medians (age-median curve). Monthly median stature H(t) and weight W(t) were normalised by their mean over months 228-239 and the discrepancy D(p) = mean_t |W(t) - H(t)^p| computed for p = 1..4 and on a 0.01 grid to find the best exponent. Slopes by age window (0-2, 2-10, 10-20, 2-20 yr) are reported descriptively.",
